Description: streaming log colorizer with native analytics
 ccze-rs is a pipeline-friendly log colorizer with parsers for syslog,
 web-server access logs, and JSON. It includes rolling anomaly detection,
 protocol-order verification, and fixed-width metric-vector export.
 .
 The package installs the standard ccze command path and includes its native
 analytics backend without requiring a compiler at runtime.
